# Generated code - DO NOT COMMIT
# Run `buf generate` to regenerate

/gen/rust/
/gen/typescript/

# /gen/go is deliberately COMMITTED. The Go services import the generated
# packages as `github.com/opus-casino/proto/gen/go/...` and resolve that module
# through `replace github.com/opus-casino/proto => ../../../libs/proto`, so the
# generated code has to live inside this module at gen/go/. Ignoring it left
# every Go service unable to resolve its protobuf imports, and `go vet ./...`
# failed with "no required module provides package
# github.com/opus-casino/proto/gen/go/common/v1".

